        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        Murrieta Concrete Works is a licensed concrete contractor serving the Murrieta and Temecula Valley area. We specialize in driveways, patios, walkways, and decorative concrete — all installed with full knowledge of Murrieta's expansive clay soil, Riverside County permit requirements, and local HOA specifications. Your contact information is never shared with other contractors.
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4">
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Pros</h4>
          <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-1">
            <li>✓ Your contact info is never sold or auctioned</li>
            <li>✓ C-8 licensed and fully insured</li>
            <li>✓ Free on-site written estimates — no phone quotes</li>
            <li>✓ Murrieta soil expertise: proper base prep for expansive clay</li>
            <li>✓ HOA approval experience in Murrieta communities</li>
            <li>✓ Handles Riverside County permit submittal</li>
          </ul>
