        <span class="font-bold text-primary">Best for:</span> Driveways, patios, walkways, and decorative concrete in Murrieta, Temecula, Wildomar, Menifee, and Lake Elsinore.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Option 2 -->
    <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-7 mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4">
        <span class="bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 font-bold text-lg rounded-full w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">2</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">Thumbtack</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm mt-1">Aggregator with contractor bids and profiles</p>
