            <li>✓ Good for small repairs (crack sealing, resurfacing small areas)</li>
            <li>✓ Price comparison across multiple bidders</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Cons</h4>
