            <li>✓ Can identify contractors with long track records of quality</li>
            <li>✓ Contact directly — your info isn't auctioned</li>
            <li>✓ Look for reviews that specifically mention durability and follow-up</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Cons</h4>
          <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-1">
            <li>— Yelp does not verify C-8 license or insurance</li>
            <li>— Review manipulation (purchased reviews) is common in the trades on Yelp</li>
            <li>— Many good local concrete contractors are not active on Yelp</li>
          </ul>
