        <span class="font-bold text-gray-800">Best for:</span> Research only — use review patterns to shortlist 2–3 contractors, then call and verify credentials independently.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Option 6 -->
    <div class="border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-7 mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4">
        <span class="bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 font-bold text-lg rounded-full w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">6</span>
