        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
        For a driveway replacement or full patio project — investments of $5,000 to $20,000+ — doing your own due diligence is worth the extra 30 minutes. Search "concrete contractor Murrieta" on Google, call the top results, and verify each contractor's C-8 license at the CSLB website before scheduling a site visit.
      </p>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4">
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Pros</h4>
          <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-1">
            <li>✓ Full control — you decide exactly who gets your contact information</li>
