        </div>
        <div>
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">Cons</h4>
          <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-1">
            <li>— You must personally verify license, insurance, and permit experience</li>
            <li>— More calls required to assemble comparable bids</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">
        <span class="font-bold text-gray-800">Best for:</span> Homeowners investing $10,000+ in concrete work who want maximum control over the contractor selection process.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

